`j : K ⟶ M^•|_W` be a morphism of complexes **on the slice over `W`**, and suppose `t` is the
image, under `j ▷ N^•|_W` and the tensorator of restriction, of a degree-zero cocycle section `y₀`
of `K ⊗ N^•|_W` over the final object of the slice. Then `M|_W` is a retract of `K` in `D(O|_W)`
