complex of the slice and not the restriction of one on `C`: this is what lets it be generated by
finitely many sections over the final object of the slice. The price is the computation of the
tensorator of derived restriction, `AlgebraicGeometry.RingedSite.restriction_coevaluation_eq`. -/
